---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../data/siteConfig.js";
---

<Layout
  title={`Speed Test | ${siteConfig.company.name}`}
  description={`Cek kecepatan koneksi internet Anda bersama ${siteConfig.company.name}.`}
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <div
    class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0d0d2b] to-[#0a0a1a] py-16 sm:py-20 border-b border-indigo-500/10"
  >
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <span
        class="inline-block text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-indigo-400 uppercase mb-2"
      >
        Network Tools
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        Uji Kecepatan Internet
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Gunakan tool di bawah ini untuk mengetahui kecepatan download, upload,
        dan ping (latency) dari koneksi internet Anda saat ini.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Speedtest Embed Section -->
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-20 bg-[#0a0a1a]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Interactive Speedtest iframe container -->
      <div
        class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden glass-card shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-900/20 border border-indigo-500/20 bg-[#0f0f2a] min-h-[600px] flex items-center justify-center relative"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500/5 to-purple-500/5 pointer-events-none"
        >
        </div>
        <iframe
          width="100%"
          height="650px"
          frameborder="0"
          src="https://www.speedtest.net/id"
          class="w-full h-[650px] relative z-10"
          title="Internet Speed Test"></iframe>
      </div>

      <div
        class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-900/10 border border-indigo-500/10 text-center"
      >
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">
          Tips Tes Kecepatan Akurat
        </h3>
        <ul
          class="text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-1 inline-block text-left list-disc list-inside"
        >
          <li>Gunakan koneksi kabel LAN/Ethernet jika memungkinkan.</li>
          <li>Jika menggunakan Wi-Fi, pastikan berada di dekat router.</li>
          <li>
            Tutup aplikasi yang mengunduh/mengunggah file besar selama
            pengetesan.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
